Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.66,0:00:10.66,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1925.334,1740)}翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果\N使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:21.38,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1925.334,1740)}翻译质量权威评价：原来25年就有小拉即用机翻糊弄人了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.41,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,大家好 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.41,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.02,0:00:04.70,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,说实话 我没想到会拍这个视频 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.02,0:00:04.70,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I was not expecting this video to happen.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.54,0:00:10.94,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,昨天（指11月4号） YouTube 把我的两个频道都封了 我当时已经做好永久失去它们的心理准备了
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.54,0:00:10.94,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, YouTube took both of my channels down and I was mentally prepared to lose them forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.54,0:00:13.99,Enderman-CN-C,1,0,0,0,,{\pos(2677.333,692)}YouTube以《该账号关联的另一个频道已被封禁》 为由随意封停了我的频道 欢迎来到2025年 能否还我一个公道？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.86,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这24小时的经历真是难以言喻 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.86,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It was a weird 24 hours I went through.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.28,0:00:21.11,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,心中不免有些伤感 一切结束得如此突然 又感到一阵空落落的 仿佛灵魂缺了一角 难以填补 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.28,0:00:21.11,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I felt a bit sad things have ended so abruptly and I felt anxious as if there was a hole in my soul I couldn't replenish.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.56,0:00:24.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,九年的心血 九年的创作 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.56,0:00:24.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,9 years of work, 9 years of content,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.64,0:00:29.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,主要记录了我不断学习的过程 每次制作的视频也越发天马行空 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:24.64,0:00:29.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,mainly of me learning throughout the process and making more and more unhinged videos every single time.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.78,0:00:34.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,临终之际 我定会回想起与YouTube相伴的岁月 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.78,0:00:34.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,YouTube is a thing I'll be certainly coming back to when I'm on my deathbed.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.28,0:00:37.68,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这方创作天地 我实在不愿失去 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:35.28,0:00:37.68,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It is a creative outlet I really don't want to lose.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.34,0:00:42.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,每次上传视频时 这个美好的社群总会给予我远超期待的温暖回馈 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.34,0:00:42.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's a beautiful community that gives so much back to me every time I upload.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.58,0:00:45.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我真的很喜欢翻阅自己视频下方的评论区 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.58,0:00:45.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I really enjoy scrolling through the comments under my videos,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.60,0:00:47.56,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,无聊时回复留言 给评论点赞 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.60,0:00:47.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,replying, hearting them when I'm bored.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.30,0:00:50.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我的频道承载着太多个人印记 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.30,0:00:50.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,My channel is definitely something personal,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.44,0:00:51.42,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它就像我的孩子一般
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.44,0:00:51.42,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,it's like a child.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.82,0:01:01.19,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs113}令我震惊的是 AI的误判竟能如此轻易地置人于死地 而由于算法默认你有罪 自证清白竟变得如此艰难
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.82,0:01:01.19,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs70}It baffles me how easy it can be killed by AI misjudgment and how difficult it is to prove your innocence because you're algorithmically guilty by default.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.90,0:01:06.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,谨以此片致敬让这个频道重获新生的团队力量 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.90,0:01:06.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I am making this video to commemorate the team effort that brought this channel back to life.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.78,0:01:09.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,科技界从未如此团结一致 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.78,0:01:09.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I've never seen the tech community so united.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.18,0:01:12.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我的声音终于被听见了 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:10.18,0:01:12.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,My voice has finally been heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:20.41,Enderman-CN-C,1,0,0,0,,{\pos(2568,294.667)}这个账号被一个AI机器人账号错误举报，因此被@YouTube封禁了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.08,0:01:19.49,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs113}2023年那场几乎导致封号的抗争中 我的声音始终被忽略 这让我一度坚信这个频道再也无法恢复生机
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.08,0:01:19.49,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The fight from 2023 when I almost got terminated and I wasn't heard really made me believe I'm not recovering the channel.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.70,0:01:21.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,所幸 事实最终证明我错了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:19.70,0:01:21.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And thankfully I was proven wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:26.54,Enderman-CN-C,1,0,0,0,,{\fs66\pos(2682.666,638.667)}这开始变成一个巨大的问题……\N最初有关在不支持的硬件上安装Windows 11的视频被下架 据称是会造成“伤害或死亡”（???）\N 现在整个频道则因为类似随意或荒谬的理由被彻底删除了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.40,0:01:24.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,虽然我们打赢了这一仗
Dialogue: 2,0:01:22.40,0:01:24.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,However, while we won a fight,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.78,0:01:26.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这暴露出整个系统性的问题 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:24.78,0:01:26.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,this is a systematic issue.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.68,0:01:30.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你们亲眼见证我频道的遭遇并非个例 而是普遍规则
Dialogue: 2,0:01:26.68,0:01:30.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What you saw happen to my channel live is a rule rather than an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.54,0:01:31.54,Enderman-CN-C,1,0,0,0,,{\pos(2002.667,390.667)}VFX传奇人物4096(@4096RED)的频道也刚刚被YouTube封禁了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.34,0:01:35.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,任何人都可能随时面临封禁 且毫无申诉机会
Dialogue: 2,0:01:31.34,0:01:35.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Everyone at any point can get banned without a chance to appeal.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.18,0:01:37.72,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,倘若我不曾拥有这般影响力 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.18,0:01:37.72,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Had I not been this popular,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.04,0:01:40.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,恐怕这个频道就再也无法恢复了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.04,0:01:40.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I would not be able to recover this channel.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.56,0:01:41.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,根本没有机会 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:40.56,0:01:41.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There is no chance.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.34,0:01:43.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,毫无生还机会 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:42.34,0:01:43.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,No shot whatsoever.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.40,0:01:46.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,如果当时推特算法背弃了我 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.40,0:01:46.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Had the twitter algorithm betrayed me,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.36,0:01:48.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,此刻我便无法与诸位对话 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:46.36,0:01:48.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I would not be talking to you right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.60,0:01:54.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这就像一把装满子弹的左轮手枪 俄罗斯轮盘赌的结局只是时间问题 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:48.60,0:01:54.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This is a Russian roulette where the revolver is completely loaded and it's only a question of time when you get shot.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.04,0:01:56.80,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,对小创作者更是如此
Dialogue: 2,0:01:55.04,0:01:56.80,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Especially when you're a smaller creator.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.82,0:02:00.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,问题在于 遭遇此境遇的远不止我一人 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:57.82,0:02:00.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The problem is I'm not the only one.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.32,0:02:03.86,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但我们每个人都在独自对抗整个AI系统 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:00.32,0:02:03.86,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But we together are alone against the AI system.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.54,0:02:07.76,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,虽然难以启齿 但事实是我们依然受制于人工智能 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:04.54,0:02:07.76,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's hard for me to say but we still are at the mercy of AI.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.36,0:02:12.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,即便所有人联合起来 也难以撼动这个庞大的系统 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:08.36,0:02:12.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We can't do anything about this on a scale even when we all unite.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.00,0:02:17.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我既非首个被误封的创作者 也绝不会是最后一个 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:13.00,0:02:17.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'm not the first to get falsely terminated and I'm not the last to get falsely terminated either.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.84,0:02:21.10,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,被永久封禁的用户实在太多太多了
Dialogue: 2,0:02:18.84,0:02:21.10,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Far, far too many people were terminated.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.90,0:02:25.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当平台放任AI摧毁人们生活时
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.90,0:02:25.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Whenever the platform allows AI to ruin people's lives,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.78,0:02:27.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,就意味着再也无法回头
Dialogue: 2,0:02:25.78,0:02:27.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,it's the point of no return.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.64,0:02:29.70,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,实话告诉你们 油管这条路走不长远
Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.64,0:02:29.70,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, YouTube is not sustainable.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.22,0:02:32.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不要放弃一切去追求这个职业
Dialogue: 2,0:02:30.22,0:02:32.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Do not drop out to pursue this career.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.82,0:02:34.90,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,更别把平台收益当作主要收入来源
Dialogue: 2,0:02:32.82,0:02:34.90,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Do not make this your main source of income.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.40,0:02:40.10,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个饭碗实在太不稳定 随时可能被切断命脉
Dialogue: 2,0:02:35.40,0:02:40.10,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's completely unstable and at any point in time you can get your lifeline cut.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.76,0:02:42.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,一定要开拓多元收入渠道
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.76,0:02:42.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Diversify your income streams.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.90,0:02:44.34,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,别只盯着油管这一亩三分地
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.90,0:02:44.34,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Don't just focus on YouTube.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.80,0:02:47.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,把全部希望押在平台上 是年轻人最致命的错误
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.80,0:02:47.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's the biggest mistake a teenager can make.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.96,0:02:50.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,充其量只能当个副业来做 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:47.96,0:02:50.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Content creation is a side hustle at best.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.12,0:02:58.49,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,幸好我明智的父母挽救了我的人生 因为我当时真的考虑过把YouTube当作全职工作 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:51.12,0:02:58.49,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And thankfully my wise parents saved my life because I genuinely thought about making YouTube my full-time job and they talked me out of it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.84,0:03:03.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我想把这段视频献给所有支持过我的人 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.84,0:03:03.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I want to dedicate this video to everyone who supported me.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.58,0:03:05.62,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,每一位在评论区留言的朋友
Dialogue: 2,0:03:03.58,0:03:05.62,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Every single person that left a comment,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.10,0:03:07.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,每一位帮忙传播的朋友
Dialogue: 2,0:03:06.10,0:03:07.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,that spread the word.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.46,0:03:09.06,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,每一位在Discord上支持我的朋友 我都看到了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:07.46,0:03:09.06,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I've seen all of you in my Discord.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.36,0:03:10.34,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我在推特上也看到了你们的支持 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:09.36,0:03:10.34,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I've seen you on Twitter.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.58,0:03:11.94,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我在Telegram上也看到了大家的支持 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.58,0:03:11.94,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I've seen you guys on Telegram.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.68,0:03:14.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我和你们并没有什么不同 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:12.68,0:03:14.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'm not much different than you,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.76,0:03:18.86,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,只是我在这个领域经验稍多一些 碰巧制作了相关视频罢了 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:14.76,0:03:18.86,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,except I have a little bit more experience in this field and I happen to make videos about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.60,0:03:24.78,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,看到这么多人聚集在我身边 让其他创作者听到我的声音 这让我深感谦卑 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:19.60,0:03:24.78,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's very humbling to see how many people gathered around me and made my voice heard by other creators.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.80,0:03:29.72,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我还要特别感谢那些站出来支持我的创作者们 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:25.80,0:03:29.72,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I want to specifically thank creators that came out and helped me as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.48,0:03:33.70,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,相信大家都认识他们 我就不一一介绍了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:30.48,0:03:33.70,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You guys probably know most of them so they need no introduction.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.18,0:03:35.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,一些普通游戏主播...
Dialogue: 2,0:03:34.18,0:03:35.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Some ordinary gamers...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.63,0:03:38.41,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我希望这是标题党 我真的希望这不是现实
Dialogue: 2,0:03:35.63,0:03:38.41,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I wish it was clickbait. I really wish this wasn't a reality
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.74,0:03:44.56,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,一个名为Enderman的频道 这个频道基本上是教育类频道
Dialogue: 2,0:03:38.74,0:03:44.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but a channel known as Enderman, who basically is a educational channel about, you know,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.58,0:03:49.31,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,关于计算机恶意软件的 现在 这个频道完全被关闭了 此页面不可用
Dialogue: 2,0:03:44.58,0:03:49.31,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,computer malware. Now, this channel got completely shut down. This page isn't available.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.31,0:03:51.78,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,对此表示歉意 请尝试搜索其他内容
Dialogue: 2,0:03:49.31,0:03:51.78,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that. Try searching for something else.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.96,0:03:52.56,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,（MoistCr1TiKaL Gaming）
Dialogue: 2,0:03:51.96,0:03:52.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Moistcritical
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.56,0:03:57.83,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs150}这个零号病人是一位名叫Enderman的YouTuber 他运营着一个科技频道
Dialogue: 2,0:03:52.56,0:03:57.83,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's this patient zero was a YouTuber named Enderman, who is a tech channel.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.03,0:04:03.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,原因是我的第二个频道被YouTube封禁了 如你所见
Dialogue: 2,0:03:58.03,0:04:03.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The reason being my secondary channel has been terminated off of YouTube. As you can see.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.38,0:04:05.80,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,如果我们仔细看看Enderman在这里提供的信息 
Dialogue: 2,0:04:03.38,0:04:05.80,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,If we look at what Enderman has provided here,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.10,0:04:15.76,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,封禁此频道的真正原因在于其关联的日本频道
Dialogue: 2,0:04:06.10,0:04:15.76,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,the reason for the termination here is this linked channel which is a Japanese channel that is in no way actually
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.76,0:04:17.42,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个日本频道实际上与Enderman毫无关联 
Dialogue: 2,0:04:15.76,0:04:17.42,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,associated with Enderman at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.60,0:04:22.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,感觉像是AI审核工具闹了个大乌龙 
Dialogue: 2,0:04:17.60,0:04:22.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It feels like it's a big ol' boo-boo here from the AI moderation tools.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.78,0:04:32.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我的名字是Eric
Dialogue: 2,0:04:30.78,0:04:32.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Hello everybody, my name is Eric.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.14,0:04:36.34,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,今天我们要讨论的是Enderman事件以及YouTube完全失控的审核系统 
Dialogue: 2,0:04:32.14,0:04:36.34,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Today we're going to be talking about the Enderman situation and YouTube's completely broken,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.58,0:04:40.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,以及那糟糕透顶 令人不齿的政策体系 
Dialogue: 2,0:04:36.58,0:04:40.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,terrible, disgraceful policy system as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.54,0:04:49.68,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,Enderman 发布了这条消息 称这可能是他最后一次上传的视频
Dialogue: 2,0:04:43.54,0:04:49.68,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Enderman posted that this was probably the last video he was ever uploading
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.89,0:04:54.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为YouTube迟早会将他删除
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.89,0:04:54.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,because it was just a matter of time before YouTube took him down.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.98,0:05:05.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,可能还有其他我忘记列入名单的创作者
Dialogue: 2,0:05:02.98,0:05:05.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There may be more creators I forgot to add to the list,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.84,0:05:10.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但这确实是数万人共同努力的成果 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:05.84,0:05:10.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but it was a true team effort spanning tens of thousands of people.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.56,0:05:12.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们在此取得的成就确实令人惊叹 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:10.56,0:05:12.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It is truly amazing what we have done here.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.20,0:05:17.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但抗争尚未结束 仍有无数账号遭受不公正封禁 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:13.20,0:05:17.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But the fight isn't over because so many people are still unjustly terminated.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.98,0:05:20.70,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,遭遇相同命运的人远比想象中多
Dialogue: 2,0:05:17.98,0:05:20.70,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There are far too many people sharing my fate.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.48,0:05:24.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,账号封禁问题比表面看起来严重得多
Dialogue: 2,0:05:21.48,0:05:24.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This termination problem is so much bigger than it looks.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.60,0:05:26.74,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这还没涉及视频下架的情况
Dialogue: 2,0:05:24.60,0:05:26.74,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And I didn't even mention video takedowns.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.04,0:05:31.68,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,若论视频下架 我仍有4个视频遭到不公正移除
Dialogue: 2,0:05:27.04,0:05:31.68,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But if we are talking about video takedowns I still have 4 videos that were taken down wrongfully.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.32,0:05:35.88,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,关于《用ChatGPT激活Windows》事件 我不再赘述
Dialogue: 2,0:05:32.32,0:05:35.88,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Activating Windows with ChatGPT I'll not repeat myself,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.02,0:05:39.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,让2023年的我来说明下架为何毫无依据
Dialogue: 2,0:05:36.02,0:05:39.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'll let 2023me explain why the takedown is unjustified.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.70,0:05:48.78,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs125}2023年5月23日 YouTube下架了一个我这辈子第一次进入主流媒体的最受粉丝喜爱的项目
Dialogue: 2,0:05:39.70,0:05:48.78,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,May 23rd, 2023, YouTube took down one of the most fan-favorite projects that even made it into mainstream media for the first time in my life,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.86,0:05:51.62,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,叫做《用ChatGPT激活Windows》
Dialogue: 2,0:05:48.86,0:05:51.62,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,called Activating Windows with ChatGPT.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.28,0:05:55.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,没错 若你曾疑惑为何该视频从YouTube消失
Dialogue: 2,0:05:52.28,0:05:55.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Yes, if you've ever wondered why that video no longer exists on YouTube,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.12,0:05:57.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,YouTube将其强制下架
Dialogue: 2,0:05:56.12,0:05:57.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,YouTube took it down.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.10,0:06:03.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,展示观众如何获得未经授权的免费音频内容的资料
Dialogue: 2,0:05:58.10,0:06:03.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Content that shows viewers how to gain unauthorized free access to audio content,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.88,0:06:05.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,本应付费的影音资源
Dialogue: 2,0:06:03.88,0:06:05.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,audio-visual content,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.70,0:06:07.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,完整电子游戏 软件
Dialogue: 2,0:06:05.70,0:06:07.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,full video games, software,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.18,0:06:11.70,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,及流媒体服务等内容是被禁止的
Dialogue: 2,0:06:08.18,0:06:11.70,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,or streaming services that normally require payment is not allowed.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.88,0:06:21.13,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我的视频展示了一个Windows 95密钥生成算法 将其输入ChatGPT以生成一个有效的Windows 95密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:06:11.88,0:06:21.13,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So my video depicts a Windows 95 key generation algorithm that I feed to ChatGPT in order to generate a valid Windows 95 key.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.70,0:06:25.74,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,让我们从一个事实开始 即 Windows 95 已成为废弃软件
Dialogue: 2,0:06:21.70,0:06:25.74,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's start with the fact that Windows 95 is abandonware.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.28,0:06:31.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,28岁的它微软根本毫不在意
Dialogue: 2,0:06:26.28,0:06:31.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's 28 years old, and Microsoft doesn't give a single shit.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.02,0:06:35.76,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,他们早在22年前就已停止支持
Dialogue: 2,0:06:32.02,0:06:35.76,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,They discontinued that operating system 22 years ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.38,0:06:40.60,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,自那以后 Windows 95的密钥算法便成了公开的秘密
Dialogue: 2,0:06:36.38,0:06:40.60,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Since then, the Windows 95 key algorithm is public knowledge,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.82,0:06:50.74,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs125}而且YouTube上已有大量视频展示如何逆向破解Windows 95的授权管理系统提取其算法
Dialogue: 2,0:06:40.82,0:06:50.74,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and there are a bunch of videos on YouTube that even show reversal of the Windows 95 licensing manager in order to extract the algorithm.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.08,0:06:53.06,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,使用ChatGPT激活Windows 11 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:51.08,0:06:53.06,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Activating Windows 11 with ChatGPT,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.16,0:06:56.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,那部视频也依然被下架了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:53.16,0:06:56.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,that video is also still taken down,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.26,0:06:57.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我的频道至今还挂着警告提示
Dialogue: 2,0:06:56.26,0:06:57.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and I still have a warning on my channel,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.50,0:07:00.78,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,尽管这个视频已经附上了两条免责声明
Dialogue: 2,0:06:58.50,0:07:00.78,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,despite this video having two disclaimers,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.18,0:07:04.10,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,片头设置了免责声明
Dialogue: 2,0:07:01.18,0:07:04.10,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,one at the beginning of the video and another in the description.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.86,0:07:11.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,之所以被错误下架 是因为ChatGPT生成的所有密钥都是公开可查的
Dialogue: 2,0:07:04.86,0:07:11.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The reason why it's wrongfully taken down is because all the keys ChatGPT generates are public and available on the
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.38,0:07:12.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,就在微软官网上
Dialogue: 2,0:07:11.38,0:07:12.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Microsoft website.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.88,0:07:14.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这些是通用密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:07:12.88,0:07:14.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,These are generic keys,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.18,0:07:15.76,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这些密钥实际上并不能真正激活系统 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:14.18,0:07:15.76,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and they don't actually activate your system.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.24,0:07:18.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这些密钥用于在不同版本之间进行升级 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:16.24,0:07:18.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You use them to upgrade between editions.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.14,0:07:20.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,对于那些不愿深入思考就急着反驳的人
Dialogue: 2,0:07:18.14,0:07:20.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,For all the smooth brains out there that argued,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.82,0:07:22.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你这次被下架真不冤
Dialogue: 2,0:07:20.82,0:07:22.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,actually, you deserve this take down,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.78,0:07:24.42,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为你这是在助长盗版行为
Dialogue: 2,0:07:22.78,0:07:24.42,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,because you're promoting piracy,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.60,0:07:27.06,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你xx给我闭嘴 连视频都没看完就在这瞎嚷嚷
Dialogue: 2,0:07:24.60,0:07:27.06,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,shut the fuck up, you haven't even watched the video,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.14,0:07:27.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你看完了吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:27.14,0:07:27.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,have you?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.24,0:07:31.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我在推特和油管上都看到过不少这种没脑子的言论 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:28.24,0:07:31.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I've seen a couple braindead takes like that both on Twitter and YouTube.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.10,0:07:36.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,另外 之前用ChatGPT激活Windows 11的方法也被下架过一次
Dialogue: 2,0:07:32.10,0:07:36.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And besides, activating Windows 11 with ChatGPT was taken down once,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.54,0:07:39.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而且申诉后视频就恢复了
Dialogue: 2,0:07:37.54,0:07:39.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and it was reinstated after an appeal.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.92,0:07:43.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,YouTube有什么理由不能再次恢复这个视频呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:39.92,0:07:43.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So what's stopping YouTube from reinstating the video one more time?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.86,0:07:48.00,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不要使用Download.com是另一个被长期下架的视频
Dialogue: 2,0:07:43.86,0:07:48.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,DontUseDownload.com is another video that's been taken down for so long,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.00,0:07:52.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我在视频里告诫大家不要信任名为Download.com的网站
Dialogue: 2,0:07:48.00,0:07:52.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,it's a video where I show you should not trust a website called Download.com,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.46,0:07:55.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为上面存在恶意广告和不良软件
Dialogue: 2,0:07:52.46,0:07:55.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,because there are malicious advertisements and bad software.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.88,0:07:58.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你可能会问 这怎么就构成危害了？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:55.88,0:07:58.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,How is that harmful and dangerous, you might ask?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.16,0:07:59.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我实在无法理解
Dialogue: 2,0:07:58.16,0:07:59.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.70,0:08:04.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,《短链接暗藏多少恶意软件》是我希望恢复的最后一个视频
Dialogue: 2,0:07:59.70,0:08:04.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,How much malware can you get from link shorteners is the final video I want back on this channel.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.06,0:08:06.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个视频早前因......被下架
Dialogue: 2,0:08:05.06,0:08:06.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's been taken down long ago for,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.04,0:08:09.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你猜怎么着 果然又是那套“有害危险”的说辞
Dialogue: 2,0:08:07.04,0:08:09.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,guess what, harmful and dangerous policy of course,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.00,0:08:10.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这可是我的最爱 
Dialogue: 2,0:08:10.00,0:08:10.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,my favorite.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.32,0:08:14.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这个视频记录了我浏览YouTube并随机点击链接的过程
Dialogue: 2,0:08:11.32,0:08:14.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's a video where I browse YouTube and click random links.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我让虚拟机感染了恶意软件
Dialogue: 2,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I get the virtual machine infected with malware,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.38,0:08:18.98,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为短链接常被用来传播恶意软件 
Dialogue: 2,0:08:16.38,0:08:18.98,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,because shortened links are often used to serve malware.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.90,0:08:23.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,看来我连展示问题严重性的权利都被剥夺了 
Dialogue: 2,0:08:19.90,0:08:23.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And I guess I'm not allowed to show how bad the situation is with that.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.98,0:08:25.86,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,即便我的频道已经恢复
Dialogue: 2,0:08:23.98,0:08:25.86,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Even after my channel was reinstated,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.20,0:08:29.98,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我在推特上通过私信联系了YouTube团队 他们回复了我 
Dialogue: 2,0:08:26.20,0:08:29.98,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I contacted Team YouTube on Twitter in DMs and they responded to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.30,0:08:33.78,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们收到了政策专家对那4部视频的复核反馈
Dialogue: 2,0:08:30.30,0:08:33.78,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We heard back from the policy specialists who reviewed the 4 videos,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.26,0:08:36.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,他们确认这些视频将继续保持下架状态 
Dialogue: 2,0:08:34.26,0:08:36.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and they confirmed they will remain down.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.14,0:08:38.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们理解这个消息令人沮丧 
Dialogue: 2,0:08:37.14,0:08:38.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We know this is frustrating news,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.14,0:08:44.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但下架原因是这些视频包含如何绕过内容或服务付费的教程
Dialogue: 2,0:08:39.14,0:08:44.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but the reason is that these videos include instructions on how to bypass payment for content or services,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.82,0:08:47.00,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这在YouTube平台是不被允许的 
Dialogue: 2,0:08:44.82,0:08:47.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which isn't permitted on YouTube.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.86,0:08:49.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不客气 这是我们应该做的 
Dialogue: 2,0:08:47.86,0:08:49.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for understanding,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.10,0:08:52.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,若有其他问题 随时为您效劳 
Dialogue: 2,0:08:50.10,0:08:52.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and here for you if anything else comes up.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.30,0:09:01.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs130}现在我实在无法理解 那个关于不要使用download.com的视频 究竟哪里违反了这条政策
Dialogue: 2,0:08:53.30,0:09:01.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Now, I really don't understand how the don't use download.com video violates this policy,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.58,0:09:04.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这看起来又是我收到的通用模板回复 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:01.58,0:09:04.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and I think it's just a generic copy-paste I received again.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.48,0:09:06.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,看来 一切照旧 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:05.48,0:09:06.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So, nothing has changed.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.68,0:09:13.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs150}如今在YouTube成功的唯一正确方式是实现规模化运营与工作流程去中心化 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:07.68,0:09:13.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The only correct way to do YouTube nowadays is to scale and decentralize your work.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.86,0:09:16.90,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我的意思是需要创建大量频道
Dialogue: 2,0:09:13.86,0:09:16.90,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What I mean by this is that you're supposed to create a ton of channels,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.28,0:09:18.62,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,持续产出内容
Dialogue: 2,0:09:17.28,0:09:18.62,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,regularly producing content,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.88,0:09:20.52,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,为你带来半被动收入 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:18.88,0:09:20.52,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,earning you semi-passive income.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.36,0:09:22.60,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,说到底都是为了赚钱 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:21.36,0:09:22.60,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It all comes down to money.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.14,0:09:30.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs140}在YouTube最高效的运营方式是建立频道矩阵 通过海量账号重复上传相同内容
Dialogue: 2,0:09:23.14,0:09:30.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The most efficient way to do YouTube is to own a network of channels that uploads the same thing over and over and over again.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.32,0:09:32.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这一点在《我的世界》游戏主播身上体现得尤为明显 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:30.32,0:09:32.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You can see this trend with Minecraft YouTubers.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.98,0:09:34.88,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,关键在于对视频内容进行优化 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:32.98,0:09:34.88,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The idea is to optimize videos,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.08,0:09:36.52,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,让制作成本不断降低
Dialogue: 2,0:09:35.08,0:09:36.52,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,make their cost lower and lower,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.02,0:09:41.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,借助人工智能工具 最终实现同时管理五个频道
Dialogue: 2,0:09:37.02,0:09:41.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,using AI tools and up to the point you can manage 5 channels simultaneously.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.76,0:09:47.86,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs143}关键词定位同样关键 这能确保你的频道在搜索结果中占据首位 超越所有竞争者
Dialogue: 2,0:09:42.76,0:09:47.86,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The keywords are also important to target so your channel comes up first in search and beats everyone else.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.60,0:09:50.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这一切都是精心优化的流水线产物
Dialogue: 2,0:09:48.60,0:09:50.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,All of it is optimized slop.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.20,0:09:52.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,并非人人都能胜任
Dialogue: 2,0:09:51.20,0:09:52.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Not everyone can do it,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.68,0:09:53.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,虽然确实需要付出艰辛努力
Dialogue: 2,0:09:52.68,0:09:53.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,granted it's hard work,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.12,0:09:57.00,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但更关乎对自身技艺的尊重
Dialogue: 2,0:09:54.12,0:09:57.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but it's more of a question of respect to your craft.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.66,0:09:59.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,归根结底是这样一个问题
Dialogue: 2,0:09:57.66,0:09:59.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It boils down to the following question,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.56,0:10:01.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你是想要安稳的被动收入
Dialogue: 2,0:09:59.56,0:10:01.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,do you want safe passive income,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.74,0:10:03.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,还是想真正享受创作乐趣？
Dialogue: 2,0:10:01.74,0:10:03.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,or do you want to enjoy your hobby?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.16,0:10:06.56,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而YouTube正在剥夺这种乐趣
Dialogue: 2,0:10:04.16,0:10:06.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And enjoying the hobby YouTube taketh away.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.12,0:10:09.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,到2025年 仅拥有单个频道已远远不够
Dialogue: 2,0:10:07.12,0:10:09.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Owning the channel is not enough in 2025.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.94,0:10:12.02,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你需要建立媒体帝国
Dialogue: 2,0:10:09.94,0:10:12.02,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You need to own a media empire,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.42,0:10:16.56,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,构建超越传统YouTuber定义的频道矩阵
Dialogue: 2,0:10:12.42,0:10:16.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,a multi-channel network that transcends the usual definition of being a YouTube creator.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.44,0:10:19.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这才是持续发展的唯一途径
Dialogue: 2,0:10:17.44,0:10:19.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,This is the only way towards sustenance.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.04,0:10:22.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不妨称之为Mr. Beast（野兽先生）模式
Dialogue: 2,0:10:20.04,0:10:22.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You could say it's the Mr. Beast formula.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.56,0:10:25.62,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而小型创作者仍将遭受不公平对待
Dialogue: 2,0:10:22.56,0:10:25.62,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,While smaller creators will continue getting treated like shit.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.92,0:10:28.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,醒醒吧 已经是2025年了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:26.92,0:10:28.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Get up baby, it's 2025.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.32,0:10:32.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是人工智能的时代 也是创作者成为产品的时候
Dialogue: 2,0:10:29.32,0:10:32.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's the age of AI and the age of creators being the product,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.28,0:10:34.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不只是观众
Dialogue: 2,0:10:33.28,0:10:34.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,not just the viewers.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.60,0:10:35.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但请记住
Dialogue: 2,0:10:34.60,0:10:35.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But let me tell you what,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.76,0:10:36.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,名利终将逝去
Dialogue: 2,0:10:35.76,0:10:36.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,your fame is temporary,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.24,0:10:40.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,唯有对社会做出的实质贡献才最具价值
Dialogue: 2,0:10:37.24,0:10:40.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but what you've actually contributed to the society matters the most.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.18,0:10:42.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,感谢观看
Dialogue: 2,0:10:41.18,0:10:42.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Thank you for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.46,0:10:44.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,衷心希望此类乱象不再重演
Dialogue: 2,0:10:42.46,0:10:44.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I really hope this atrocity doesn't happen again.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.50,0:10:46.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们需要解禁被封禁的创作者
Dialogue: 2,0:10:45.50,0:10:46.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We need people unbanned.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.40,0:10:50.00,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,需要由真人来审核视频内容
Dialogue: 2,0:10:47.40,0:10:50.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And we need humans like us to review our videos.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.66,0:10:51.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,请多保重
Dialogue: 2,0:10:50.66,0:10:51.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:57.58,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1909.333,1342.667)}在 Youtube 上关注\N\N原标题：We lost 原作者：Enderman\N原视频上传日期：2025年11月6日\N翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果\N翻译质量权威评价：原来25年就有小拉即用机翻糊弄人了\N\N字幕制作不易，喜欢的话支持一下我吧！
